  "releaseNotes": "Release candidate for optional default Fiskaly credentials and runtime-scoped execution.\n\nHighlights:\n- default ApiKey/ApiSecret are now optional at startup\n- requests without default or scoped credentials now fail only at execution time\n- added Management API write support for organizations and API keys\n- added scoped credentials for per-organization execution\n- added typed API key query models and resilient identifier deserialization\n- strengthened unit and integration coverage for the new surface",
